data-tex=\"\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\subseteq\\psi\">\\(\\theta\\subseteq\\psi\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotCon}_{93}(\\psi,\\theta;\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotCon}_{93}(\\psi,\\theta;\\mathbf A)\\)</span> is the induced relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau)\\)</span> defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\)</span> have the signatures of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> is the isomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}third\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotCon}_{93}(\\psi,\\theta;\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\theta),\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(b;\\mathbf A,\\theta)\n\\right\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\psi\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}third\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotCon}_{93}(\\psi,\\theta;\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\theta),\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(b;\\mathbf A,\\theta)\n\\right\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\psi\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}third\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\theta\\subseteq\\psi\n\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{QuotCon}_{93}(\\psi,\\theta;\\mathbf A)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau))\n\\land\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\Bigl(h,\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{QuotCon}_{93}(\\psi,\\theta;\\mathbf A);\\tau\\bigr),\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\psi;\\tau)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}third\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\theta\\subseteq\\psi\n\\to\\Bigl(\\mathrm{QuotCon}_{93}(\\psi,\\theta;\\mathbf A)\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau))\n\\land\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\Bigl(h,\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{QuotCon}_{93}(\\psi,\\theta;\\mathbf A);\\tau\\bigr),\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\psi;\\tau)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Nested quotients collapse to the quotient by the larger congruence.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-third-isomorphism---Third-Isomorphism","text":"lem-third-isomorphism - Third Isomorphism","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"",